{
  "libs/engine/adapter-demo/README.md": "# adapter-demo

Implements DemoPort for demo: say in one or two sentences what it talks to.

Tags: \`type:adapter\`, \`runtime:node\`.

## Public API

- \`DemoAdapter\`: the DemoPort implementation.
- \`createDemoAdapter()\`: the hook the shared port contract suite uses.

## Invariants

- Imports only contracts, pure, port and \`net-*\` projects (blueprint 2.2); never a service.
- Only this project imports left-pad (third-party confinement, blueprint 2.4); the row is in \`eslint.config.mjs\`.
- Passes the DemoPort contract suite.

## Proof commands

\`\`\`sh
pnpm nx run-many -t lint typecheck test -p adapter-demo
\`\`\`
